<title>HONG KONG: HKR Int'l interim profit jumps 82.3 pct.</title>
<headline>HKR Int'l interim profit jumps 82.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   61.9    vs  34.7</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    9.0     vs  8.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil     vs  nil</p>
<p>    Net			    590.4   vs  323.80</p>
<p>    Turnover		     2,045.1 vs  1,573.00</p>
<p>    Company name		 HKR International Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  January 16-18</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   January 23</p>
<p>NOTE - HKR International is a property investment and development company.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
